* The base case for the recursion is when the length of the array is 1 or less, in which case we simply return the original array (O(1) complexity).
* When merging the two sorted arrays, we use the spread operator (`...`) to concatenate them into a single array and then sort it using the `sort` method with a comparison function that compares elements by their values.

