4. The `Visit` method recursively visits each child node, printing its value to the console.

**Complexity:**

The time complexity of this implementation is O(n^2), where n is the number of nodes in the tree. This is because for each node, we visit all its children (which can take up to O(n) time), and there are potentially n nodes in the worst-case scenario (a linked list).

